      },
      "level": 1,
      "desc": [
        "You know how to strike subtly and exploit a foe's distraction. Once per turn, you can deal extra damage to one creature you hit with an attack roll if you have Advantage on the roll. The attack must use a Finesse or Ranged weapon. You don't need Advantage if another enemy of the target is within 5 feet of it, that enemy isn't incapacitated, and you don't have Disadvantage. The extra damage is 1d6 at level 1 and increases as you gain Rogue levels."
      ],
      "feature_specific": {
        "dice_count": 1,
        "dice_value": 6
